  "releaseNotes": "[Version 9.5.6.0] - Updated on Sep 23rd 2025:\n---\n(1) Fixed a bug in TableColumnAttribute to add square brackets around the name returned.\n(2) Fixed a bug in SqlStatementBuilder to compose fully qualified aliased names (\"t.[Id]\" earlier is now returned as \"t.[Id] as [table].[Id]\")\n(3) Propagated changes for fix#2 above to SqlLambdaVisitor's VisitMember function (see foreign key IF block at the end)",
